&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Lead Product Manager needed to own the product strategy, discovery, delivery and adoption of on of our key clients digital transformations.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Lead Product Manager, you will be accountable for translating business and customer needs into a clear product strategy and measurable outcomes. You will lead cross-functional teams through discovery, development, launch and continuous improvement, while building alignment across senior stakeholders, clients and delivery teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a strategic leadership role, not solely a backlog-management position. We are looking for someone who can operate confidently from product vision and commercial strategy through to detailed execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product vision, strategy and roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and communicate the product vision, strategy and long-term direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align the product strategy with organisational objectives, customer needs, commercial priorities and the wider strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the target customer, value proposition, product principles and strategic outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain an outcome-focused product roadmap spanning multiple workstreams or product squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate market insight, customer problems, operational needs and technology opportunities into clear product opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance short-term delivery with longer-term platform capabilities, scalability, technical health and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product investment decisions and clearly articulate the expected customer and business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer discovery and market leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead customer discovery, user research, journey mapping, problem definition and validation activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve workflows, efficiency, collaboration and visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer insight, market research and competitive analysis to inform product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional leadership and delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multidisciplinary teams across Product, Engineering, Architecture, UX/UI, Data, AI, Quality Assurance, Security and Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clarity on the customer problem, desired outcomes, priorities and decision-making principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish effective discovery and delivery practices across the product lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure product teams have clear epics, requirements, user stories, acceptance criteria and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineering teams to make pragmatic trade-offs between scope, quality, time, cost and technical risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a healthy, prioritised backlog without losing sight of the wider product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and remove blockers, manage delivery risks and resolve cross-team dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead release planning, readiness reviews, rollout planning and post-launch evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve product and delivery ways of working across the programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Agile approaches pragmatically, including Scrum, Kanban and continuous discovery practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior stakeholder and executive engagement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary product representative for senior internal stakeholders, clients and programme governance forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate product strategy, progress, outcomes, risks, dependencies and trade-offs clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build alignment across global, regional and functional stakeholders with competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate effective decision-making and provide recommendations when information is incomplete or ambiguous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product leadership and capability development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership, coaching and mentoring to Product Managers, Product Owners and cross-functional delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set high standards for product discovery, prioritisation, communication, documentation and outcome measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish and continuously improve the organisation’s product management practices and operating model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a culture of customer empathy, accountability, collaboration and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead through influence, creating clarity and momentum even where you do not have direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent and strengthen the product function across the wider organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we want from you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring significant experience in product management, with a proven track record of leading complex products from strategy through to delivery and adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience as a Product Manager, Senior Product Manager or Lead Product Manager within a B2B/D2C Commerce or digital transformations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience owning product strategy, roadmap, prioritisation and outcomes across complex products or platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering workflow, project management, operations or back-office SaaS solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading greenfield product development, platform transformation or the replacement of legacy systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple product squads, delivery teams or interconnected workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering measurable customer, operational or commercial outcomes—not just features or project milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with senior executives, enterprise clients and complex stakeholder groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating effectively in a large, global organisation with formal governance and complex decision-making processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of commerce eco- systems and online Customer Experience , preferably including agency operating models, workflows and client-service environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Agile, Lean and modern product management practices, including Scrum, Kanban, continuous discovery and outcome-based planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to move comfortably between strategic thinking, customer discovery, commercial planning and delivery detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, presentation, facilitation and influencing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial awareness and the ability to connect product decisions to revenue, efficiency, customer value and organisational strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, critical-thinking and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence making decisions in ambiguous environments and managing complex trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead, coach and motivate people through influence, with or without direct line-management responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised, self-directed and comfortable taking ownership of significant initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilient, pragmatic and able to maintain momentum in a fast-moving transformation programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using product and delivery tools such as Jira, Confluence, Aha!, Productboard or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you have some of this, even better&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A recognised Product Management or Agile Product Owner certification is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside the opportunity to work with some of the most exciting brands around the world, we’ll also prioritise your career development and help you grow your skills. We’ll empower you to make a difference, allow you to be yourself, and respect who you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We lead with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.&lt;br&gt;We empower your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Brains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.&lt;br&gt;And we champion&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Courage&lt;/strong&gt;, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;How we use AI in the recruitment process:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;To ensure more focused and engaging conversations, we&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;leverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;AI in our recruitment process exclusively for secure, objective&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;note-taking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;, never for evaluative judgments. This allows our team to be fully present with you. You are always welcome to request a transcript of these notes or opt out of this feature at any time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Opting out will not&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;impact&amp;nbsp; the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;outcome of the interview process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions is part of&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence and world-class partnerships – all united by our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions). Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job title: &lt;/strong&gt;Director of Product &amp;amp; Tech Delivery&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bristol or London (hybrid)&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; £130,400 - £163,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Product &amp;amp; Tech Operations&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; VP Product &amp;amp; Tech Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is based in either Bristol or London and requires an existing right to work in the UK.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today&#39;s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future. Leveraging Data, AI, and real-time decision-making we turn energy complexity into growth opportunities for our partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable and affordable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the VP Product &amp;amp; Tech Operations, you’ll own the timely, predictable execution of our Product &amp;amp; Technology roadmap, for Kaluza and for our clients, across our global product, field deployment, and platform foundations teams. You’ll line-manage Heads and Group Delivery Managers, set the standard for how delivery is done across the function, and provide the leadership confidence around what we can deliver, both near-term and further ahead. You’ll move fluently between board-level narrative and the detail of a single stuck dependency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role spans four focus areas:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run delivery at scale &lt;/strong&gt;- own predictable, end-to-end execution across your portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implementing an AI-native system of wor&lt;/strong&gt;k - make AI-assisted delivery the default and raise the bar on how delivery is done, partnering with our P&amp;amp;T business operations team to implement best practices across our product development lifecycle (PDLC) that are designed and standardised by the Business Operations team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow an independent, high-performing delivery community&lt;/strong&gt; - build a function that solves its own problems, and has a “yes if” attitude to solving the inevitable challenges of the day to day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner and Influence at the Executive Level&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run delivery at scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own and drive successful delivery across Kaluza’s Product and Tech organisation, typically multiple streams that may align to client programmes or global initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end delivery of the Product &amp;amp; Tech roadmap across your area, e.g. across multiple client streams (OVO &amp;amp; ENGIE in Europe, AGL &amp;amp; Shell in APAC) or multiple global product streams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement evolutions of a standard methodology that allows the business to scale and ensures successful client implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive absolute roadmap alignment, delivery enablement and reporting at multiple levels, from team detail to executive overview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring confidence to what we can deliver, near-term and further ahead through robust capacity planning, milestone tracking (actuals vs estimates), forecasting, and proactive management and resolution of cross-team dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, UX and Client Delivery leadership so deliverables meet client capabilities, support needs and timelines, and so client feedback flows back into the delivery process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide objective, data-led neutral insight on how delivery is really going; proactively escalate risks and issues early, and drive decisions with senior leadership and clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed good practices into our internal delivery management practices that are developed by the Business Operations team, and provide input to shape their future roadmap.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deputise for the VP when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implement an AI-native system of work through delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the strategic evolution of our delivery practices by embedding AI-assisted methodologies into default operational workflows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed AI-assisted delivery into reporting, forecasting, capacity and effort analysis, dependency mapping, risk detection and status communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push the boundaries of Jira, JQL and agentic workflows; build dashboards and reporting that drive development forward at pace and replace manual effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplify and standardise practice across Product &amp;amp; Tech: refine ways of working, embed Agile &amp;amp; Lean practice, and raise predictability and the effort-to-value ratio in your area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a change driver, co-own the delivery of a roadmap of improvements to our system of work alongside Business Operations, and bring people with you through the change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion continuous improvement and show the function what good, AI-native delivery looks like in practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow an independent, high-performing delivery community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build a self-sufficient, empowered function that is a gold standard for getting things done, effectively, and with transparency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a group of people leaders and delivery managers, Heads of, Group and Lead) Delivery Managers, setting clear objectives, focus and clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach the team to navigate complexity and uncertainty, to self-solve, and to bias their effort towards Kaluza’s goals and our client commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know the product and coach the team to understand the product domain for their area so that they can enable cross-functional team delivery of the product roadmap and client delivery goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and upskill across the community; show the team what good looks like and raise the standard across the board.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear the barriers that stop Product teams focusing on innovation and strategy, and Engineering teams focusing on technical excellence and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Delivery function in achieving its strategy and goals, and champion the wider change and planning agenda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an innovative thinker and member of the larger Kaluza SLT team to drive the business forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner and Influence at the Executive Level&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted partner to Product, Engineering, UX, and Client Delivery leadership, serving as an active member of the Senior Leadership Team (SLT)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidently manage relationships with C-level clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver objective tracking, milestone visibility + forecasting, and proactive risk mitigation strategies to leadership, while serving as a strategic deputy for the VP of Product &amp;amp; Tech Operations when required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re an accomplished delivery leader with a strong track record. Ideally, you’ll be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; an executor: you define what good looks like, take full accountability, and go looking for what you need rather than waiting for a brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely AI-native: AI tools feel like leverage, not an afterthought. You have deep curiosity in innovation and AI tools, actively pushing AI adoption into delivery practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steady in ambiguity: A nimble leader who thrives in complex undefined spaces, is comfortable diving into problems at multiple altitudes, and the steady presence others rely on when the path isn’t fully defined.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Delivery Leader: An accomplished delivery leader and a bar raiser when it comes to of managing large-scale, cross-functional delivery management functions within a high-growth SaaS environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced leading delivery management at scale: line-managing and developing people leaders, across cross-functional Product &amp;amp; Engineering teams using agile methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to design and evolve delivery operating models, governance and ways of working, with an openness to follow current Kaluza practice and refine where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A trusted partner: to Product &amp;amp; Engineering leadership, able to influence senior leadership,and credible with C-level clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong listener, people leader &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; coach: able to empower teams and colleagues to reach their full potential, and to bring people along on a change journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent with Jira, or similar roadmapping tools, with real curiosity about using JQL and AI to generate dashboards and reporting that drive development at pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable switching between team-level detail and executive-level overview, applying the right approach in the right context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Committed to radical candour: you ask hard questions, and give honest developmental feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will set you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience managing delivery frameworks across major global energy utility accounts or multi-regional client programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven background or curiosity in implementing an AI-integrated Product Development Lifecycle alongside business operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with a requirement of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance + Virtual GP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Furthr - a Climate Action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Mortgage Advice and Eye Tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks at Work - access to thousands of retail discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% Flex Fund - to spend on the benefits you want most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday + bank holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Leave Policy - With no qualifying service periods, including up to 26 weeks full pay for primary caregivers and 4 weeks full pay for secondary caregivers when welcoming a new addition to your family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal Learning Budget - Upskill, learn and grow!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life. Our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about working in &lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com&quot;&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can also find our Applicant Data Protection Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;At Superchat, we&#39;re rebuilding how businesses talk to their customers. AI is becoming the engine of that communication. Integrations are what give that engine teeth: the data, the tools, the systems that turn a clever agent into one that actually closes loops.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2020, Superchat has become the platform of choice for &lt;strong&gt;10,000+ businesses worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;, from globally recognized brands like Allianz, Auto1, Enpal, Danone, and GASAG to the small businesses, dental practices, and one-person startups that need to look bigger than they are. Today, &lt;strong&gt;millions of messages flow through Superchat every single day&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started as a unified inbox: one place for every channel a customer might pick, WhatsApp, email, SMS, Instagram. Then ChatGPT happened, and the second chapter began: AI agents that respond across chat, email, and voice at the quality of the best human teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re &lt;strong&gt;100 people&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;profitable&lt;/strong&gt;, and have raised &lt;strong&gt;€18M in funding&lt;/strong&gt; (last round 4.5 years ago, we&#39;ve been growing on our own money since). Headquartered in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Product Manager to join our Integrations team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll own the surface that decides whether our AI agents are clever demos or systems that actually do work. CRM sync, appointment bookings, call transfers, custom workflows: every action our agents take in the real world runs through your team. Plus our public API, webhooks, and the developer experience that lets partners build on top of us. If you&#39;re excited to design APIs, ship agent tooling, and own a surface that gets more strategic every quarter, this might be a great fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re reshaping our product function around three pillars, AI, Integrations, and Core, with a PM in each, operating directly with our founder and CPO Mika. This role is for Integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;This role is technical, but you won&#39;t be writing the code&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll design API surfaces, debate OAuth and webhook patterns, and hold your own with senior engineers and external partner teams. The engineers write the code. Your job is to read it when needed, sketch API designs, argue technical trade-offs, and make sure what we ship is well architected. An engineering background, or serious hands-on coding experience, is what gets you that credibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Location &amp;amp; work mode&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Berlin-based, minimum 3 days a week in-office, up to 2 days optional home office. We build better in the same room. Decisions happen faster, products ship faster, and the team stays sharper. EU work permit required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own integrations, the public API, and webhooks end-to-end: strategy, spec, build, launch, measure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the tools that turn our AI agents from clever responders into systems that close loops: agent to CRM, agent to appointment, agent to handover, agent to custom workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close to customers and partners every week, in direct calls, by talking to CS, sales, and BD, and by digging into the data yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed with 4 to 6 engineers, set the metric, and own whether it moves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treat the public API and webhooks as a product, with proper DX, docs, and a real roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make integration setup something a customer completes in minutes, alone, without a CSM walking them through it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own quality. Engineers test as they build, you give the final go before anything ships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the launch and the awareness that follows. There is no product marketing team. You drive positioning, the in-product moments, and the keynote for the big launches, with marketing and sales behind you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across squads with the AI and Core PMs on the surfaces that touch each other&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shipping things people actually use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering background or strong hands-on coding experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional product and operational judgement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in OAuth, webhooks, rate limits, retries, and API versioning. Tool-calling and function-calling patterns a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shameless customer obsession&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extreme clarity in writing and thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speed without sloppiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low ego and a builder&#39;s instinct&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and meaningful VSOP at a profitable, growing company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern Berlin office in Prenzlauer Berg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct work with the founders and a real seat at the product table&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team that ships fast and doesn&#39;t drown in process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days of paid vacation, plus 2 extra days off for Christmas and New Year&#39;s Eve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual personal development budget for conferences, courses, books, or coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular team events, off-sites, and the kind of culture that makes you want to be in the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;See how we ship&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every year we publish a Rewind: a public record of everything we built and shipped. Probably the easiest way to see what we&#39;ve been up to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.superchat.de/superchat-rewind-2025&quot;&gt;Superchat Rewind 2025&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.superchat.de/superchat-rewind-2024&quot;&gt;Superchat Rewind 2024&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We firmly believe that diversity makes companies better. We welcome all applicants - regardless of gender, background, nationality, or religion. Feel free to send us your application!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/native/f601741cb4f24d418411aa0ff86c3787?pvs=21&amp;amp;deepLinkOpenNewTab=true&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We look forward to your application! 🙂&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/Uicf3C7.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At JetBrains, code is our passion. The Kotlin plugin for IntelliJ IDEA is where language meets experience — it&#39;s how hundreds of thousands of developers write, navigate, refactor, and understand Kotlin code every day. Being able to continuously improve it means understanding the language deeply, using the product daily, and deeply caring about Kotlin developers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Technical Product Manager who will own the Kotlin-in-IDE experience end to end. This is a deeply hands-on role. You will experiment with Kotlin in IntelliJ based IDEs every day, maintain reference projects that double as regression canaries and demo showcases, build prototypes with AI coding agents, analyze users feedback and talk to users. You won&#39;t manage from slides — you&#39;ll manage from the editor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product vision for the Kotlin plugin: fast, correct, and trustworthy IDE support that evolves with the language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use IntelliJ IDEA with the Kotlin plugin daily — dogfooding features, catching regressions, and validating the developer experience first-hand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and develop reference Kotlin projects that serve as showcases for new features, material for conference demos, and a living test bed for DX quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build prototypes and proofs-of-concept using AI coding agents to explore and validate new capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and continuously adapt the plugin roadmap across short-term release goals, mid-term initiatives, and longer-term Kotlin ecosystem related projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align plugin planning with Kotlin compiler releases, IntelliJ IDEA release trains, and Android Studio constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make explicit trade-offs and say &quot;no&quot; when cost, risk, or maintenance burden outweighs user value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define problem statements, success criteria, and scope for features — then collaborate with engineers to validate and refine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent core Kotlin personas — JVM backend developers, library authors, Android and Multiplatform teams — and prioritize recurring pain points: false positives, slow analysis, unreliable refactorings, onboarding pain points,&amp;nbsp; AI agents integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a consistent pipeline of monthly user interviews to ground decisions in real workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Kotlin language team, Developer Advocates, framework partners, Marketing, and other JetBrains teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create external visibility through what&#39;s-new posts, Kotlin User Groups meetup talks, and feature previews at events like KotlinConf, Spring I/O, Devoxx and others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has professional software development experience in Java or Kotlin (this is a must).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has 5+ years of experience in technical product management or a comparable role in a complex technical domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is a hands-on product person who lives in the product, not someone who operates through reports and meetings alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience with AI coding tools and agents, and curiosity about how they reshape developer workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can define clear roadmaps with problem statements, success criteria, and explicit trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has strong communication skills in English — written and spoken — for both technical peers and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is ready to represent the product externally at conferences, in blog posts, and in community interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes developer experience personally — not as an abstract metric, but as something they feel in their own daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d be especially thrilled if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience developing IntelliJ plugins or working with the IntelliJ Platform SDK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have built or contributed to evaluation pipelines, benchmarks, or quality measurement systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have given technical talks or published content aimed at developer audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work location. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote work. Spend up to 30 days per year working remotely from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance allowance. Enjoy peace of mind for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support. We help make your move as smooth and stress-free as possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language classes. Pick up the local language or sharpen your English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your day. Enjoy a hot meal or receive a lunch allowance on workdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support. To help you feel your best, we provide easy access to professional mental health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports benefit. Enjoy an on-site gym or sports club stipend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Join company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Some benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;/p&gt;
